{
  "book": "jacob",
  "bookName": "Jacob",
  "chapter": 4,
  "voice": {
    "provider": "elevenlabs",
    "voice_id": "ddDFRErfhdc2asyySOG5",
    "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
    "settings": {
      "stability": 0.5,
      "similarity_boost": 0.75,
      "style": 0.35,
      "use_speaker_boost": true
    },
    "name": "Samuel"
  },
  "pauses": {
    "line_ms": 180,
    "verse_ms": 500
  },
  "duration": 351.515,
  "lines": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 5.619,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now behold, it came to pass that I, Jacob, having ministered much unto my people in word,",
      "verse": "4:1",
      "lineIndex": 1
    },
    {
      "start": 5.799,
      "end": 12.672,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "(and I cannot write but a little of my words, because of the difficulty of engraving our words upon plates)",
      "verse": "4:1",
      "lineIndex": 2
    },
    {
      "start": 12.852,
      "end": 17.96,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and we know that the things which we write upon plates must remain;",
      "verse": "4:1",
      "lineIndex": 3
    },
    {
      "start": 18.64,
      "end": 23.423,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But whatsoever things we write upon anything save it be upon plates",
      "verse": "4:2",
      "lineIndex": 4
    },
    {
      "start": 23.603,
      "end": 25.786,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "must perish and vanish away;",
      "verse": "4:2",
      "lineIndex": 5
    },
    {
      "start": 25.966,
      "end": 28.799,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but we can write a few words upon plates,",
      "verse": "4:2",
      "lineIndex": 6
    },
    {
      "start": 28.979,
      "end": 31.162,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which will give our children,",
      "verse": "4:2",
      "lineIndex": 7
    },
    {
      "start": 31.342,
      "end": 33.385,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and also our beloved brethren,",
      "verse": "4:2",
      "lineIndex": 8
    },
    {
      "start": 33.565,
      "end": 36.212,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "a small degree of knowledge concerning us,",
      "verse": "4:2",
      "lineIndex": 9
    },
    {
      "start": 36.392,
      "end": 38.25,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "or concerning their fathers\u2014",
      "verse": "4:2",
      "lineIndex": 10
    },
    {
      "start": 38.93,
      "end": 41.159,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now in this thing we do rejoice;",
      "verse": "4:3",
      "lineIndex": 11
    },
    {
      "start": 41.339,
      "end": 45.426,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and we labor diligently to engraven these words upon plates,",
      "verse": "4:3",
      "lineIndex": 12
    },
    {
      "start": 45.606,
      "end": 48.857,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "hoping that our beloved brethren and our children",
      "verse": "4:3",
      "lineIndex": 13
    },
    {
      "start": 49.037,
      "end": 51.498,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "will receive them with thankful hearts,",
      "verse": "4:3",
      "lineIndex": 14
    },
    {
      "start": 51.678,
      "end": 54.418,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and look upon them that they may learn with joy",
      "verse": "4:3",
      "lineIndex": 15
    },
    {
      "start": 54.598,
      "end": 57.709,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and not with sorrow, neither with contempt,",
      "verse": "4:3",
      "lineIndex": 16
    },
    {
      "start": 57.889,
      "end": 60.211,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "concerning their first parents.",
      "verse": "4:3",
      "lineIndex": 17
    },
    {
      "start": 60.891,
      "end": 64.095,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For, for this intent have we written these things,",
      "verse": "4:4",
      "lineIndex": 18
    },
    {
      "start": 64.275,
      "end": 66.736,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that they may know that we knew of Christ,",
      "verse": "4:4",
      "lineIndex": 19
    },
    {
      "start": 66.916,
      "end": 71.188,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and we had a hope of his glory many hundred years before his coming;",
      "verse": "4:4",
      "lineIndex": 20
    },
    {
      "start": 71.368,
      "end": 74.851,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and not only we ourselves had a hope of his glory,",
      "verse": "4:4",
      "lineIndex": 21
    },
    {
      "start": 75.031,
      "end": 78.05,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but also all the holy prophets which were before us.",
      "verse": "4:4",
      "lineIndex": 22
    },
    {
      "start": 78.73,
      "end": 82.585,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold, they believed in Christ and worshiped the Father in his name,",
      "verse": "4:5",
      "lineIndex": 23
    },
    {
      "start": 82.765,
      "end": 85.133,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and also we worship the Father in his name.",
      "verse": "4:5",
      "lineIndex": 24
    },
    {
      "start": 85.313,
      "end": 88.099,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And for this intent we keep the law of Moses,",
      "verse": "4:5",
      "lineIndex": 25
    },
    {
      "start": 88.279,
      "end": 90.369,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "it pointing our souls to him;",
      "verse": "4:5",
      "lineIndex": 26
    },
    {
      "start": 90.549,
      "end": 95.054,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and for this cause it is sanctified unto us for righteousness,",
      "verse": "4:5",
      "lineIndex": 27
    },
    {
      "start": 95.234,
      "end": 96.999,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "even as it was accounted",
      "verse": "4:5",
      "lineIndex": 28
    },
    {
      "start": 97.179,
      "end": 103.82,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "unto Abraham in the wilderness to be obedient unto the commands of God in offering up his son Isaac,",
      "verse": "4:5",
      "lineIndex": 29
    },
    {
      "start": 104.0,
      "end": 107.808,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which is a similitude of God and his Only Begotten Son.",
      "verse": "4:5",
      "lineIndex": 30
    },
    {
      "start": 108.488,
      "end": 110.578,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Wherefore, we search the prophets,",
      "verse": "4:6",
      "lineIndex": 31
    },
    {
      "start": 110.758,
      "end": 113.962,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and we have many revelations and the spirit of prophecy;",
      "verse": "4:6",
      "lineIndex": 32
    },
    {
      "start": 114.142,
      "end": 116.232,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and having all these witnesses",
      "verse": "4:6",
      "lineIndex": 33
    },
    {
      "start": 116.412,
      "end": 120.22,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "we obtain a hope, and our faith becometh unshaken,",
      "verse": "4:6",
      "lineIndex": 34
    },
    {
      "start": 120.4,
      "end": 123.558,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "insomuch that we truly can command in the name of Jesus",
      "verse": "4:6",
      "lineIndex": 35
    },
    {
      "start": 123.738,
      "end": 125.828,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the very trees obey us,",
      "verse": "4:6",
      "lineIndex": 36
    },
    {
      "start": 126.008,
      "end": 127.401,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "or the mountains,",
      "verse": "4:6",
      "lineIndex": 37
    },
    {
      "start": 127.581,
      "end": 129.392,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "or the waves of the sea.",
      "verse": "4:6",
      "lineIndex": 38
    },
    {
      "start": 130.072,
      "end": 135.738,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Nevertheless, the Lord God showeth us our weakness that we may know that it is by his grace,",
      "verse": "4:7",
      "lineIndex": 39
    },
    {
      "start": 135.918,
      "end": 139.308,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and his great condescensions unto the children of men,",
      "verse": "4:7",
      "lineIndex": 40
    },
    {
      "start": 139.488,
      "end": 141.949,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that we have power to do these things.",
      "verse": "4:7",
      "lineIndex": 41
    },
    {
      "start": 142.629,
      "end": 146.066,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold, great and marvelous are the works of the Lord.",
      "verse": "4:8",
      "lineIndex": 42
    },
    {
      "start": 146.246,
      "end": 150.054,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "How unsearchable are the depths of the mysteries of him;",
      "verse": "4:8",
      "lineIndex": 43
    },
    {
      "start": 150.234,
      "end": 153.763,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and it is impossible that man should find out all his ways.",
      "verse": "4:8",
      "lineIndex": 44
    },
    {
      "start": 153.943,
      "end": 158.169,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And no man knoweth of his ways save it be revealed unto him;",
      "verse": "4:8",
      "lineIndex": 45
    },
    {
      "start": 158.349,
      "end": 162.111,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "wherefore, brethren, despise not the revelations of God.",
      "verse": "4:8",
      "lineIndex": 46
    },
    {
      "start": 162.791,
      "end": 165.206,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For behold, by the power of his word",
      "verse": "4:9",
      "lineIndex": 47
    },
    {
      "start": 165.386,
      "end": 167.847,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "man came upon the face of the earth,",
      "verse": "4:9",
      "lineIndex": 48
    },
    {
      "start": 168.027,
      "end": 171.464,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which earth was created by the power of his word.",
      "verse": "4:9",
      "lineIndex": 49
    },
    {
      "start": 171.644,
      "end": 175.22,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Wherefore, if God being able to speak and the world was,",
      "verse": "4:9",
      "lineIndex": 50
    },
    {
      "start": 175.4,
      "end": 178.001,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and to speak and man was created,",
      "verse": "4:9",
      "lineIndex": 51
    },
    {
      "start": 178.181,
      "end": 180.689,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "O then, why not able to command the earth,",
      "verse": "4:9",
      "lineIndex": 52
    },
    {
      "start": 180.869,
      "end": 186.395,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "or the workmanship of his hands upon the face of it, according to his will and pleasure?",
      "verse": "4:9",
      "lineIndex": 53
    },
    {
      "start": 187.075,
      "end": 190.233,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Wherefore, brethren, seek not to counsel the Lord,",
      "verse": "4:10",
      "lineIndex": 55
    },
    {
      "start": 190.413,
      "end": 192.781,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but to take counsel from his hand.",
      "verse": "4:10",
      "lineIndex": 56
    },
    {
      "start": 192.961,
      "end": 200.252,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For behold, ye yourselves know that he counseleth in wisdom, and in justice, and in great mercy, over all his works.",
      "verse": "4:10",
      "lineIndex": 57
    },
    {
      "start": 200.932,
      "end": 207.573,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Wherefore, beloved brethren, be reconciled unto him through the atonement of Christ, his Only Begotten Son,",
      "verse": "4:11",
      "lineIndex": 58
    },
    {
      "start": 207.753,
      "end": 212.861,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and ye may obtain a resurrection, according to the power of the resurrection which is in Christ,",
      "verse": "4:11",
      "lineIndex": 59
    },
    {
      "start": 213.041,
      "end": 216.849,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and be presented as the first-fruits of Christ unto God,",
      "verse": "4:11",
      "lineIndex": 60
    },
    {
      "start": 217.029,
      "end": 220.373,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "having faith, and obtained a good hope of glory in him",
      "verse": "4:11",
      "lineIndex": 61
    },
    {
      "start": 220.553,
      "end": 223.339,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "before he manifesteth himself in the flesh.",
      "verse": "4:11",
      "lineIndex": 62
    },
    {
      "start": 224.019,
      "end": 227.363,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now, beloved, marvel not that I tell you these things;",
      "verse": "4:12",
      "lineIndex": 63
    },
    {
      "start": 227.543,
      "end": 230.608,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for why not speak of the atonement of Christ,",
      "verse": "4:12",
      "lineIndex": 64
    },
    {
      "start": 230.788,
      "end": 233.342,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and attain to a perfect knowledge of him,",
      "verse": "4:12",
      "lineIndex": 65
    },
    {
      "start": 233.522,
      "end": 236.448,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "as to attain to the knowledge of a resurrection",
      "verse": "4:12",
      "lineIndex": 66
    },
    {
      "start": 236.628,
      "end": 238.253,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the world to come?",
      "verse": "4:12",
      "lineIndex": 67
    },
    {
      "start": 238.933,
      "end": 241.487,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold, my brethren, he that prophesieth,",
      "verse": "4:13",
      "lineIndex": 68
    },
    {
      "start": 241.667,
      "end": 244.686,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "let him prophesy to the understanding of men;",
      "verse": "4:13",
      "lineIndex": 69
    },
    {
      "start": 244.866,
      "end": 247.838,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for the Spirit speaketh the truth and lieth not.",
      "verse": "4:13",
      "lineIndex": 70
    },
    {
      "start": 248.018,
      "end": 251.315,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Wherefore, it speaketh of things as they really are,",
      "verse": "4:13",
      "lineIndex": 71
    },
    {
      "start": 251.495,
      "end": 253.817,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and of things as they really will be;",
      "verse": "4:13",
      "lineIndex": 72
    },
    {
      "start": 253.997,
      "end": 259.709,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "wherefore, these things are manifested unto us plainly, for the salvation of our souls.",
      "verse": "4:13",
      "lineIndex": 73
    },
    {
      "start": 259.889,
      "end": 263.279,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But behold, we are not witnesses alone in these things;",
      "verse": "4:13",
      "lineIndex": 74
    },
    {
      "start": 263.459,
      "end": 266.524,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for God also spake them unto prophets of old.",
      "verse": "4:13",
      "lineIndex": 75
    },
    {
      "start": 267.204,
      "end": 270.176,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But behold, the Jews were a stiffnecked people;",
      "verse": "4:14",
      "lineIndex": 77
    },
    {
      "start": 270.356,
      "end": 272.817,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they despised the words of plainness,",
      "verse": "4:14",
      "lineIndex": 78
    },
    {
      "start": 272.997,
      "end": 274.483,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and killed the prophets,",
      "verse": "4:14",
      "lineIndex": 79
    },
    {
      "start": 274.663,
      "end": 277.542,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and sought for things that they could not understand.",
      "verse": "4:14",
      "lineIndex": 80
    },
    {
      "start": 277.722,
      "end": 279.998,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Wherefore, because of their blindness,",
      "verse": "4:14",
      "lineIndex": 81
    },
    {
      "start": 280.178,
      "end": 283.15,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which blindness came by looking beyond the mark,",
      "verse": "4:14",
      "lineIndex": 82
    },
    {
      "start": 283.33,
      "end": 284.955,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "they must needs fall;",
      "verse": "4:14",
      "lineIndex": 83
    },
    {
      "start": 285.135,
      "end": 288.061,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for God hath taken away his plainness from them,",
      "verse": "4:14",
      "lineIndex": 84
    },
    {
      "start": 288.241,
      "end": 292.328,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and delivered unto them many things which they cannot understand,",
      "verse": "4:14",
      "lineIndex": 85
    },
    {
      "start": 292.508,
      "end": 294.18,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "because they desired it.",
      "verse": "4:14",
      "lineIndex": 86
    },
    {
      "start": 294.36,
      "end": 296.264,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And because they desired it",
      "verse": "4:14",
      "lineIndex": 87
    },
    {
      "start": 296.444,
      "end": 298.905,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "God hath done it, that they may stumble.",
      "verse": "4:14",
      "lineIndex": 88
    },
    {
      "start": 299.585,
      "end": 303.857,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now I, Jacob, am led on by the Spirit unto prophesying;",
      "verse": "4:15",
      "lineIndex": 89
    },
    {
      "start": 304.037,
      "end": 311.839,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for I perceive by the workings of the Spirit which is in me, that by the stumbling of the Jews they will reject the stone",
      "verse": "4:15",
      "lineIndex": 90
    },
    {
      "start": 312.019,
      "end": 315.548,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "upon which they might build and have safe foundation.",
      "verse": "4:15",
      "lineIndex": 91
    },
    {
      "start": 316.228,
      "end": 318.689,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But behold, according to the scriptures,",
      "verse": "4:16",
      "lineIndex": 92
    },
    {
      "start": 318.869,
      "end": 323.606,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "this stone shall become the great, and the last, and the only sure foundation,",
      "verse": "4:16",
      "lineIndex": 93
    },
    {
      "start": 323.786,
      "end": 325.876,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "upon which the Jews can build.",
      "verse": "4:16",
      "lineIndex": 94
    },
    {
      "start": 326.556,
      "end": 332.825,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now, my beloved, how is it possible that these, after having rejected the sure foundation,",
      "verse": "4:17",
      "lineIndex": 95
    },
    {
      "start": 333.005,
      "end": 334.863,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "can ever build upon it,",
      "verse": "4:17",
      "lineIndex": 96
    },
    {
      "start": 335.043,
      "end": 337.644,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that it may become the head of their corner?",
      "verse": "4:17",
      "lineIndex": 97
    },
    {
      "start": 338.324,
      "end": 342.782,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold, my beloved brethren, I will unfold this mystery unto you;",
      "verse": "4:18",
      "lineIndex": 98
    },
    {
      "start": 342.962,
      "end": 344.727,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "if I do not, by any means,",
      "verse": "4:18",
      "lineIndex": 99
    },
    {
      "start": 344.907,
      "end": 347.461,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "get shaken from my firmness in the Spirit,",
      "verse": "4:18",
      "lineIndex": 100
    },
    {
      "start": 347.641,
      "end": 350.845,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and stumble because of my over anxiety for you.",
      "verse": "4:18",
      "lineIndex": 101
    }
  ]
}